00:16:59,740 --> 00:17:04,260
If the enemy advances this far, we
will be surrounded and slaughtered.

255
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:09,080
Our only option is to engage
them in this narrow ravine,

256
00:17:09,260 --> 00:17:12,380
which is 100 miles wide
and 1,000 miles long.

257
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:17,417
We will set up a defensive position here,
absorb their charge, and grind them down.

258
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:19,937
This will be the basic
thrust of our strategy.

259
00:17:20,020 --> 00:17:22,196
Does anyone have any thoughts so far?

260
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:25,337
I have a concern.

261
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:29,220
The enemy has ogres and longbows,
and even more dangerous,

262
00:17:29,460 --> 00:17:31,166
dark mages of untold numbers.

263
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:34,125
How can we counteract
their long-range attacks?

264
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,780
I have an idea on that.

265
00:17:38,980 --> 00:17:42,333
There is no sunlight in that
ravine, even during the day.

266
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:44,060
Not even the grass grows.

267
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:46,960
Sacred power is sparse there at best.

268
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:51,337
But in theory, if we absorb the
power from the battlefield first,

269
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:54,302
their mages won't be able
to use it to attack us.

270
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:57,655
The same is true for our side as well.

271
00:17:58,040 --> 00:18:01,780
At the present, we only have
100 who can wield the arts.

272
00:18:02,260 --> 00:18:05,757
If we allow the battle to come
down to our wielders and theirs,

273
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,664
theirs will use far more power.

274
00:18:07,820 --> 00:18:10,560
The arts are not just
used for combat, though.

275
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:13,760
If all the sacred power is exhausted,

276
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:17,657
healing the lives of our critically
wounded will be next to impossible.

277
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:19,800
I admit, it is a risky gamble,

278
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:23,337
which is why we brought all the reagents
and healing potions from the capital.

279
00:18:23,420 --> 00:18:27,357
If we use our sacred arts only for
healing and the potions for support,

280
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:30,322
the reagents should last
for at least three days.

281
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:34,340
There is one more issue, if I may.

282
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:38,376
While Solus and Terraria's
blessings are sparse there,

283
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:41,197
during the battle, with
each warrior who falls,

284
00:18:41,280 --> 00:18:44,197
more sacred power will be
released and accumulate.

285
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:46,957
I do not see how we can
absorb all those extra

286
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:49,577
resources if there are
not enough of us to do so.

287
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:50,980
We can.

288
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:53,840
Well, actually, one of us can.

289
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:55,550
Who?

290
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,940
Why you, Alice Synthesis 30.

291
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,957
Perhaps you haven't realized it yet,

292
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:05,297
but your power has surpassed that of
all the Integrity Knights in the land,

293
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:07,720
and you are ready to use it now.

294
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:11,660
A godlike power that can
split heaven and earth.

295
00:19:12,740 --> 00:19:15,960
Would you please look after
Kirito and keep him safe?

296
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,497
Yes, you can count on us.

297
00:19:18,580 --> 00:19:20,227
Lady Alice, don't you worry.

298
00:19:20,420 --> 00:19:23,126
We promise we will protect
him with our lives.

299
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:30,280
Kirito, I must leave, and I
do not know if I shall return.

300
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:37,840
You saved my life, and I will use all of
it, to the last drop if I have to. And so,

301
00:19:38,100 --> 00:19:41,980
should I fall in battle and call
you with the last of my breath,

302
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:44,629
would you stand and
draw your sword for me?

303
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:48,897
With you awake, it would not matter
how many thousands the enemy has.

304
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:53,880
You will perform another miracle
and protect everyone, as before.

305
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:05,220
After all, you were the one
who defeated the Administrator.

306
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:08,100
You are the greatest swordsman ever.

307
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,560
Lady Alice.

308
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:16,280
Are you ready to go?

309
00:20:18,900 --> 00:20:20,520
Eldrie? Yes?

310
00:20:21,580 --> 00:20:22,410
Milady?

311
00:20:23,540 --> 00:20:24,420
Thank you.

312
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:26,260
You have served me well.

313
00:20:27,260 --> 00:20:31,500
I was blessed to have you by my side,
even though it was not for long.

314
00:20:32,100 --> 00:20:34,960
You chose an amateur like
me to be your mentor,

315
00:20:35,260 --> 00:20:38,020
instead of a male veteran
like Serdeo Selbert.

316
00:20:38,300 --> 00:20:40,340
Was that out of sympathy for me?

317
00:20:40,620 --> 00:20:41,820
No, not at all!

318
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:44,000
I would never be so disrespectful!

319
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:49,361
I chose you because I was so in awe of your
sword technique and skills as a warrior.

320
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:55,260
And it is due to your unwavering support
that I was able to survive to see this day.

321
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,060
I thank you.

322
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:03,620
Lady Alice, you speak with such finality.

323
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:08,334
It is as if you think your journey,
instead of going on, is about to end.

324
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:10,040
It cannot!

325
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:13,060
I still have not learned
all I can from you!

326
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:16,940
My technique, my arts,
I am nowhere near ready.

327
00:21:17,280 --> 00:21:22,360
I still need you to continue my training
and guide me to be a better knight.

328
00:21:22,580 --> 00:21:25,320
Integrity Knight, Eldrie Synthesis 31.

329
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:27,320
Yes, m 'lady.

330
00:21:27,560 --> 00:21:30,080
As your mentor, here are my final orders.

331
00:21:30,740 --> 00:21:32,080
You will survive.

332
00:21:32,300 --> 00:21:34,457
Survive to witness peace in the land.

333
00:21:34,540 --> 00:21:39,480
And after, you will seek out your true life
and take it back, and the one you love.

334
00:21:43,060 --> 00:21:43,890
That's it.

335
00:22:17,100 --> 00:22:18,500
Yeah!

336
00:23:38,220 --> 00:23:39,050
I
